WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.502 --> 00:00:14.470
The man on the road continued to wave a warning.

2
00:00:15.450 --> 00:00:18.673
Trembling with fear, the Tang Monk fell from his horse.

3
00:00:19.493 --> 00:00:21.755
Wujing rushed over to help him stand up.

4
00:00:23.236 --> 00:00:25.297
"I'll be right back," said Wukong.

5
00:00:25.317 --> 00:00:29.060
"I'll ask that man what sort of danger is up ahead."

6
00:00:29.984 --> 00:00:31.645
The monkey walked toward the man.

7
00:00:37.388 --> 00:00:42.170
Looking closely, Wukong could tell that he was not an ordinary man.

8
00:00:42.190 --> 00:00:47.012
"Hello, Venus," said Wukong with a smile.

9
00:00:48.092 --> 00:00:49.153
man smiled back.

10
00:00:49.173 --> 00:00:52.294
"Yes, it's me, the spirit of the planet Venus.

11
00:00:53.295 --> 00:00:55.516
I came in disguise to warn you, Wukong.

12
00:00:56.620 --> 00:01:00.102
There are three powerful demons on the mountain up ahead.

13
00:01:01.143 --> 00:01:02.784
The first is a lion demon.

14
00:01:03.785 --> 00:01:05.386
second is an elephant demon.

15
00:01:06.327 --> 00:01:08.228
And the third is a raptor demon."

16
00:01:10.149 --> 00:01:10.910
monkey shrugged.

17
00:01:10.930 --> 00:01:12.431
"Thanks for the warning, Venus.

18
00:01:13.091 --> 00:01:15.973
But I'm not worried about three silly demons."

19
00:01:17.174 --> 00:01:18.335
Venus shook his head.

20
00:01:18.815 --> 00:01:19.556
should be worried.

21
00:01:20.256 --> 00:01:22.918
The three demons command a demon army."

22
00:01:24.919 --> 00:01:25.700
rubbed his chin.

23
00:01:26.768 --> 00:01:28.329
"Once again, thank you for the warning.

24
00:01:28.990 --> 00:01:32.273
But even an entire army of demons doesn't worry me."

25
00:01:34.394 --> 00:01:36.316
nodded. "Very well, Wukong.

26
00:01:36.916 --> 00:01:37.477
Good luck!"

27
00:01:38.938 --> 00:01:40.139
The spirit vanished.

28
00:01:41.180 --> 00:01:43.222
The monkey walked back to his companions.

29
00:01:47.805 --> 00:01:48.566
said Bajie.

30
00:01:48.586 --> 00:01:50.407
"What did the man say?

31
00:01:50.948 --> 00:01:52.189
Is there danger up ahead?"

32
00:01:53.069 --> 00:01:53.810
"Are there demons?"

33
00:01:54.210 --> 00:01:55.932
asked the Tang Monk, still scared.

34
00:01:57.184 --> 00:01:59.365
"Actually, yes," said Wukong.

35
00:02:00.445 --> 00:02:01.665
an army of demons.

36
00:02:02.146 --> 00:02:03.306
But I'm not worried."

37
00:02:04.966 --> 00:02:06.687
Tang Monk's jaw dropped.

38
00:02:06.707 --> 00:02:09.308
"How can you not be worried?"

39
00:02:10.268 --> 00:02:11.248
Wukong laughed.

40
00:02:11.268 --> 00:02:13.229
"Master, have you forgotten?

41
00:02:14.029 --> 00:02:16.410
I once defeated Heaven's entire army."

42
00:02:17.410 --> 00:02:18.530
Wujing frowned.

43
00:02:18.550 --> 00:02:21.571
"Yes, we all know about that, Wukong.

44
00:02:22.772 --> 00:02:23.772
this is different.

45
00:02:24.460 --> 00:02:27.201
The Tang Monk is with us—we must keep him safe."

46
00:02:28.442 --> 00:02:29.462
Bajie nodded.

47
00:02:29.482 --> 00:02:32.384
"Yes, and I'd like to be safe too."

48
00:02:34.224 --> 00:02:36.505
sighed. "You're right.

49
00:02:37.306 --> 00:02:39.707
We can't let the demons harm Master."

50
00:02:41.268 --> 00:02:44.409
gave a sideways glance at Bajie and smirked.

51
00:02:44.849 --> 00:02:45.730
"Or the pig."

52
00:02:46.810 --> 00:02:48.011
Bajie snorted.

53
00:02:48.031 --> 00:02:50.952
"You all wait here," said Wukong.

54
00:02:51.664 --> 00:02:54.746
"I'll check out the mountain to see how big the demon army is."

55
00:02:57.027 --> 00:02:58.588
The monkey flew to the mountain.

56
00:03:02.690 --> 00:03:05.311
Several demons were talking in front of a cave.

57
00:03:05.912 --> 00:03:08.173
They were dressed like military officers.

58
00:03:09.374 --> 00:03:12.035
Wukong spied on them from behind a rock.

59
00:03:12.055 --> 00:03:17.338
"The Tang Monk will be coming over our mountain soon," said a demon general.

60
00:03:17.358 --> 00:03:20.900
"Our leaders want all the troops to watch for him."

61
00:03:21.796 --> 00:03:24.877
"I hope we catch the Tang Monk," said a captain.

62
00:03:24.897 --> 00:03:28.779
"I've heard that anyone who eats him will live forever."

63
00:03:30.500 --> 00:03:31.340
was furious.

64
00:03:31.360 --> 00:03:34.001
"How dare they plan to eat Master!"

65
00:03:35.021 --> 00:03:36.542
The demons were still talking.

66
00:03:36.562 --> 00:03:38.943
"But who will get to eat the monk?"

67
00:03:39.303 --> 00:03:40.283
asked another captain.

68
00:03:40.303 --> 00:03:43.465
"There are thousands of troops in our army."

69
00:03:43.485 --> 00:03:47.406
"We'll all get to eat him," said the general.

70
00:03:47.426 --> 00:03:51.388
"Our leaders promised to share him with the entire army."

71
00:03:52.480 --> 00:03:54.842
The other officers nodded and smiled.

72
00:03:54.862 --> 00:03:59.285
"That was very kind of our leaders," said a captain.

73
00:03:59.305 --> 00:04:03.748
"We must be careful though," warned the general.

74
00:04:03.768 --> 00:04:06.329
"Why?" asked a colonel.

75
00:04:07.290 --> 00:04:08.931
monk is just a man.

76
00:04:09.171 --> 00:04:11.052
He can't possibly stop us."

77
00:04:11.152 --> 00:04:16.576
"I've heard that the Tang Monk isn't alone," said the general.

78
00:04:16.596 --> 00:04:19.378
"Sun Wukong is with him."

79
00:04:21.019 --> 00:04:22.280
Everyone grew quiet.

80
00:04:23.456 --> 00:04:27.618
"He's the spirit who defeated Heaven's entire army," whispered a captain.

81
00:04:29.058 --> 00:04:29.859
captain nodded.

82
00:04:29.879 --> 00:04:31.279
"He is quite powerful."

83
00:04:32.100 --> 00:04:34.561
Wukong beamed proudly when he heard that.

84
00:04:34.581 --> 00:04:38.862
"Don't worry about Sun Wukong," said the general.

85
00:04:38.882 --> 00:04:42.304
"Just tell the troops to watch for the Tang Monk."

86
00:04:42.324 --> 00:04:45.065
"Yes, General," said the colonel.

87
00:04:45.085 --> 00:04:48.506
"I have an idea," thought Wukong.

88
00:04:49.607 --> 00:04:52.248
The monkey made himself look like a demon general.

89
00:04:55.244 --> 00:04:59.313
Then he stepped out from behind the rock and hurried over to the officers.

90
00:04:59.333 --> 00:05:01.818
"I have good news!"

91
00:05:02.119 --> 00:05:03.041
shouted Wukong.

92
00:05:03.061 --> 00:05:06.207
"The Tang Monk is heading toward our mountain!"
